# `figmint.toml` is NOT here, and that is the point. It is the record — the
# evidence this whole project is about — so it is committed like any other
# source of truth, alongside the artifacts it describes and the lock file it
# names. A figmint project that ignores its own record is one where nobody can
# check anything without rebuilding first.

# The rendered site: a build output, and the one artifact whose absence the
# record can survive. Run `make all` and it appears.
/_site/
/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# The installed copy of the filter, which lives in this repository already.
/_extensions/

# uv's own directory, not the lock file.
/.venv/
